<title>TURKEY: TURKEY SETS 287-D T-BILL AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>TURKEY SETS 287-D T-BILL AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday 287-day (9-1/2-month) bills after it last sold 125.6 trillion lira of the same maturity bills at 103.44 percent yield on February 7.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : December 10, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: February 25, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : February 26, 1997</p>
<p>The Treasury has 155 trillion lira of domestic debt repayments on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
